          "text": "Catering Options – Venue Hire at Toynbee Hall;﻿"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Enjoy bespoke catering from our trusted partners when you hire our event spaces"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "When you hire a space at Toynbee Hall, we offer a selection of catering options to suit every event. From corporate lunches, board meetings, and networking events to private celebrations, birthdays, and community gatherings, our catering partners provide high-quality, locally sourced menus that will delight your guests."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Explore our catering partners:"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "image": {
            "src": "https://www.toynbeehall.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Screenshot-2025-11-24-093107.png",
