            "caption": "Screenshot 2025-11-24 093107"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "TRADE"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Trade offers modern British catering with a gourmet twist. Think truffle‑cheese puffs, pastrami sandwiches, seasonal salads, and indulgent chocolate brownies – perfect for corporate lunches, networking events, or private celebrations."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "image": {
            "src": "https://www.toynbeehall.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Screenshot-2025-11-24-093341.png",
