            "caption": "Screenshot 2025-11-24 093341"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "KARMA CANS"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Karma Cans delivers fresh, seasonal, and sustainable meals. Their tiffin-style offerings include chickpea curry bowls, roasted vegetable sandwiches, and carrot cake, ideal for board meetings, conferences, and casual gatherings."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "image": {
            "src": "https://www.toynbeehall.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Screenshot-2025-11-24-093643.png",
            "alt": "Photograph from Toynbee Hall",
            "caption": "Screenshot 2025-11-24 093643"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "OITIJ JO KICTHEN"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "OiTij Jo Kitchen brings authentic Bangladeshi flavours to your event. Guests can enjoy lamb kebabs, vegetable samosas, jeera pilau, and traditional halwa, making it a great choice for receptions, community events, or full dinner menus."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "image": {
            "src": "https://www.toynbeehall.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Screenshot-2025-11-24-093906.png",
