            "caption": "Screenshot 2025-11-24 093906"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "SHOOTS & LEAVES"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Shoots & Leaves provides vibrant, modern catering with fresh, sustainable ingredients. Their menu features sharing platters, seasonal salads, and gourmet canapés, suited to creative workshops, networking events, and intimate celebrations"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
